kvxputer — Cardputer ADV firmware
=================================

This project forks and extends Bruce firmware for M5Stack Cardputer ADV,
with optional M5 Unit Scroll support and ports of Evil-Cardputer–unique tools.

The active firmware tree is at the repository root (platformio.ini, src/, boards/).
The resources/ directory holds demo/reference sources only and is not compiled.

